This is simliar to what Moria does.  The base damage/AC is always displayed. 
After all, all cloaks give you +0 to AC (base)  When you wield/put it on, you
can find out if it's cursed (you can't take it off!) but you can't Id any
+'s.  The onscren numbers (AC, etc) reflect the AC points that you know about,
not your real AC.  I think it's much more realistic.

